%% MUPP-070 Sizes dialog narrower, Secret Santa wish list folds out
flowchart TD
    A[Member opens Din önskelista] --> B[Rows are folded: title and chevron only R3 R4]
    B -->|press a row| C[Row folds out: Beskrivning, Storlek, link, pencil and bin R3 R4]
    C -->|press the row again| B
    C -->|pencil| D[Edit form card; save shows the new text in the row]
